OL,3,GNEWSAA nosy polar bear and a lucky
OL,4,Asquirrel: Wildlife Photographer of the
OL,5,AYear 2026 shortlist
OL,6,
OL,7,FHow would it feel to find yourself face
OL,8,Fto face with one of the Arctic's most
OL,9,Fformidable predators?
OL,11,FThis stunning image captures life from
OL,12,Fa seal's perspective. Taken by
OL,13,FNorwegian wildlife photographer Audun
OL,14,FRikardsen, it was among the 'Highly
OL,15,FCommended' entries in this year's
OL,16,FWildlife Photographer of the Year
OL,17,Fcompetition.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
