OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1787721999
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA nosy polar bear and a lucky
OL,4,Asquirrel: Wildlife Photographer of the
OL,5,AYear 2026 shortlist
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile working as a guide with Arctic
OL,8,FWildlife Tours, Rikardsen rigged an
OL,9,Funderwater camera with a motion sensor
OL,10,Fbeneath a seal's breathing hole, and
OL,11,Fthen waited. At 4am, a female polar
OL,12,Fbear approached and peered down.
OL,14,FRikardsen then waited eight hours for
OL,15,Fthe bear to move away before retrieving
OL,16,Fthe camera and reviewing the images.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
